msgid "They say that a manes won't mince words with you."
msgstr "Dicen que un manes no se andará con rodeos contigo."

#: dat/rumors.fal:209
msgid "They say that a mind is a terrible thing to waste."
msgstr "Dicen que una mente es algo terrible para desperdiciar."

#: dat/rumors.tru:203
msgid ""
"They say that a mirror will freeze a floating eye but you can still see it."
msgstr "Dicen que un espejo congela a un ojo flotante, pero aún puedes verlo."

